          "6.  Imam Musa Kadhim (a.s.) says, “One who does the Ziyarat of  Imam  Husain  (a.s.)  near  River  Euphrates  knowing  his right, honor and love its minimum reward is that all the sins, past and future, will be forgiven.”"
